From: Qwen Code <qwen@example.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026
Subject: [PATCH] Add CachingCredentialStore — session-lifetime password cache

Add a CachingCredentialStore wrapper that caches credentials loaded
from the system keychain for the lifetime of the session.  A new
cache_passwords setting (default: true) controls the feature; when
enabled, repeated load() calls for the same (account_id, slot) pair
return the cached value without contacting the secret-service D-Bus
interface, reducing latency and D-Bus traffic.

The cache is invalidated on store(), delete() and delete_all()
so that writes and deletes are always durable.

The setting can be toggled at runtime through
CachingCredentialStore::set_caching_enabled().

